{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_017cWqbhWdhgLmh889BcKY8x", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Think_I%27m_Go_Go\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Squeeze_(Squeeze_album)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://music.douban.com/subject/26629606\"}, {\"url\": \"https://planetmellotron.com/revs18.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://slicingupeyeballs.com/?p=64175\"}, {\"url\": \"https://thenewvinylvillain.com/2023/03/07/an-imaginary-compilation-album-xxx-squeeze/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.irishnews.com/entertainment/squeezes-glenn-tilbrook-says-bands-next-album-is-maybe-our-last-5HIKLHLFMNPI5PIAE4AAYGUOS4/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://music.mxdwn.com/2015/12/23/news/watch-squeeze-release-new-video-for-cradle-to-the-grave/amp/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://alchetron.com/I-Think-I'm-Go-Go\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:57:21.901Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Squeeze \"I Think I'm Go Go\" song album release", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01WybsefK6tYGh7iRm78CyqL", "content": [{"title": "I Think I%27m Go Go", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Think_I%27m_Go_Go"}, {"title": "Squeeze (Squeeze album)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Squeeze_(Squeeze_album)"}, {"title": "music.douban.com", "url": "https://music.douban.com/subject/26629606"}, {"title": "planetmellotron.com", "url": "https://planetmellotron.com/revs18.htm"}, {"title": "slicingupeyeballs.com", "url": "https://slicingupeyeballs.com/?p=64175"}, {"title": "AN IMAGINARY COMPILATION ALBUM : #334: SQUEEZE", "url": "https://thenewvinylvillain.com/2023/03/07/an-imaginary-compilation-album-xxx-squeeze/"}, {"title": "squeezes glenn tilbrook says bands next album is maybe our last 5HIKLHLFMNPI5PIAE4AAYGUOS4", "url": "https://www.irishnews.com/entertainment/squeezes-glenn-tilbrook-says-bands-next-album-is-maybe-our-last-5HIKLHLFMNPI5PIAE4AAYGUOS4/"}, {"title": "WATCH: Squeeze Release New Video For “Cradle To The Grave”", "url": "https://music.mxdwn.com/2015/12/23/news/watch-squeeze-release-new-video-for-cradle-to-the-grave/amp/"}, {"title": "Neha Patil (Editor)", "url": "https://alchetron.com/I-Think-I'm-Go-Go"}]}, "The song is from Squeeze's 1980 album *Argybargy*. It was released as a single in February 1980, recorded in 1979, and issued on A&M. Chris Difford wrote the lyrics and Glenn Tilbrook wrote the music. Wikipedia lists the song's release as February 1980 on A&M, with Difford and Tilbrook credited as songwriters.\n\nOne source gives a different year. The New Vinyl Villain describes it as an album track from 1981's Argybargy, but the other sources point to 1980.\n\nThe lyrics are about touring. Difford has said \"I think I'm go go\" was the turn of phrase in the band at the time. Tilbrook said it's very Beatles-like and also has a similar sound to our song, 'The Knack'."], "durationSeconds": 5.2389181659999995, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_017cWqbhWdhgLmh889BcKY8x", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
