{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXXkKh9h4psL14kh5Cv", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:约 2 年。**\n\n- 《I Think I'm Go Go》是 Squeeze 的歌,收录在 1980 年的专辑 *Argybargy*。搜索结果称它在 1980 年 2 月作为单曲发行。有一个来源(New Vinyl Villain)把专辑年份写成 1981,但其他来源都指向 1980。\n- 《E.T.》在美国院线上映的日期是 1982 年 6 月 11 日。更早在 1982 年 5 月 26 日,它作为闭幕片在戛纳电影节首映。\n\n1982 − 1980 = **2 年**。按具体日期算,1980 年 2 月到 1982 年 6 月约 2 年 4 个月。如果按戛纳首映算,是约 2 年 3 个月。\n\n我没有核对 Wikipedia 页面原文,上面的日期来自搜索摘要。\n\nSources:\n- [I Think I'm Go Go – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Think_I%27m_Go_Go)\n- [Today in film history: June 11th, 1982 – E.T. is released in theaters](https://www.westporttechmuseum.com/blogs/techtastic/today-in-film-history-june-11th-1982-e-t-the-extra-terrestrial-is-released-in-theaters)\n- [E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial – Wikipedia 镜像](https://solarspell-dls.sfis.asu.edu/mea/wikipedia/wp/e/E.T._the_Extra-Terrestrial.htm)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1252, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6363, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1252}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:57:30.993Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXXk1brgT1VBNWK3wca"}
